<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<style xmlns="http://purl.org/net/xbiblio/csl" version="1.0" class="in-text" demote-non-dropping-particle="never" default-locale="pt-BR">
  <info>
    <title>Escola de Comando e Estado-Maior do Exército - Instituto Meira Mattos - ABNT</title>
    <title-short>ECEME - IMM - ABNT</title-short>
    <id>http://www.zotero.org/styles/escola-de-comando-e-estado-maior-do-exercito-instituto-meira-mattos-abnt</id>
    <link href="http://www.zotero.org/styles/escola-de-comando-e-estado-maior-do-exercito-instituto-meira-mattos-abnt" rel="self"/>
    <link href="https://colecaomeiramattos.com.br/CMM/references" rel="documentation"/>
    <link href="https://colecaomeiramattos.com.br/CMM/about/submissions" rel="documentation"/>
    <link href="https://ebrevistas.eb.mil.br/index.php/ADN/about/submissions" rel="documentation"/>
    <link href="https://ompv.eceme.eb.mil.br/ompv/normas-para-submissao" rel="documentation"/>
    <author>
      <name>Marlos M. Corrêa</name>
      <email>marlos.mc@gmail.com</email>
    </author>
    <category citation-format="author-date"/>
    <category field="generic-base"/>
    <summary>Estilo autor-data em português brasileiro fundamentado nas ABNT NBR 6023:2025 e 10520:2023; título e subtítulo devem estar reunidos no campo title; limites de CSL documentados separadamente. Não é publicação oficial da ECEME. Elaborado com apoio de IA (ChatGPT e Gemini). / Brazilian Portuguese author-date style based on ABNT NBR 6023:2025 and 10520:2023; title and subtitle must be combined in the title field; CSL limitations documented separately. Not an official ECEME publication. Developed with AI assistance (ChatGPT and Gemini).</summary>
    <updated>2026-11-17T15:35:00+00:00</updated>
    <rights license="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/">This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 License</rights>
  </info>
  <locale xml:lang="pt-BR">
    <terms>
      <term name="et-al">et al.</term>
      <term name="and">e</term>
      <term name="no date">[s. d.]</term>
      <term name="in">In:</term>
      <term name="accessed">Acesso em:</term>
      <term name="available at">Disponível em:</term>
      <term name="page" form="short">
        <single>p.</single>
        <multiple>p.</multiple>
      </term>
      <term name="number-of-pages" form="short">
        <single>p.</single>
        <multiple>p.</multiple>
      </term>
      <term name="edition" form="short">ed.</term>
      <term name="volume" form="short">v.</term>
      <term name="issue" form="short">n.</term>
      <term name="editor" form="short">
        <single>org.</single>
        <multiple>orgs.</multiple>
      </term>
      <term name="month-01" form="short">jan.</term>
      <term name="month-02" form="short">fev.</term>
      <term name="month-03" form="short">mar.</term>
      <term name="month-04" form="short">abr.</term>
      <term name="month-05" form="short">maio</term>
      <term name="month-06" form="short">jun.</term>
      <term name="month-07" form="short">jul.</term>
      <term name="month-08" form="short">ago.</term>
      <term name="month-09" form="short">set.</term>
      <term name="month-10" form="short">out.</term>
      <term name="month-11" form="short">nov.</term>
      <term name="month-12" form="short">dez.</term>
    </terms>
  </locale>
  <macro name="author-cite">
    <choose>
      <if variable="author">
        <names variable="author">
          <name form="short" delimiter="; " delimiter-precedes-last="always"/>
          <substitute>
            <text variable="title" form="short"/>
          </substitute>
        </names>
      </if>
      <else-if variable="editor">
        <names variable="editor">
          <name form="short" delimiter="; "/>
        </names>
      </else-if>
      <else>
        <text variable="title" form="short" text-case="capitalize-first"/>
      </else>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <macro name="author-bib">
    <choose>
      <if variable="author">
        <names variable="author" delimiter="; ">
          <name name-as-sort-order="all" sort-separator=", " delimiter="; " initialize-with=". " delimiter-precedes-last="always">
            <name-part name="family" text-case="uppercase"/>
          </name>
          <substitute>
            <names variable="editor"/>
          </substitute>
        </names>
      </if>
      <else-if variable="editor">
        <names variable="editor" delimiter="; ">
          <name name-as-sort-order="all" sort-separator=", " initialize-with=". ">
            <name-part name="family" text-case="uppercase"/>
          </name>
          <label form="short" prefix=" (" suffix=")"/>
        </names>
      </else-if>
      <else>
        <text variable="title" text-case="capitalize-first"/>
      </else>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <macro name="issued-year">
    <choose>
      <if variable="issued">
        <date variable="issued">
          <date-part name="year"/>
        </date>
      </if>
      <else>
        <text term="no date"/>
      </else>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <macro name="issued-full">
    <choose>
      <if variable="issued">
        <date variable="issued" delimiter=" ">
          <date-part name="day"/>
          <date-part name="month" form="short"/>
          <date-part name="year"/>
        </date>
      </if>
      <else>
        <text term="no date"/>
      </else>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <macro name="title-bib">
    <choose>
      <if variable="author editor" match="any">
        <choose>
          <if type="article-journal article-magazine article-newspaper chapter paper-conference entry-encyclopedia entry-dictionary" match="any">
            <text variable="title"/>
          </if>
          <else>
            <text variable="title" font-weight="bold"/>
          </else>
        </choose>
      </if>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <macro name="publication">
    <group delimiter=": ">
      <text variable="publisher-place"/>
      <text variable="publisher"/>
    </group>
  </macro>
  <macro name="edition">
    <choose>
      <if variable="edition" match="any">
        <group delimiter=" ">
          <text variable="edition"/>
          <text term="edition" form="short"/>
        </group>
      </if>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <macro name="online">
    <choose>
      <if variable="URL">
        <group delimiter=" ">
          <text term="available at"/>
          <text variable="URL"/>
        </group>
        <choose>
          <if variable="accessed">
            <group prefix=". " delimiter=" ">
              <text term="accessed"/>
              <date variable="accessed" delimiter=" ">
                <date-part name="day"/>
                <date-part name="month" form="short"/>
                <date-part name="year"/>
              </date>
            </group>
          </if>
        </choose>
      </if>
      <else-if variable="DOI">
        <text variable="DOI" prefix="DOI: "/>
      </else-if>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <citation et-al-min="4" et-al-use-first="1" disambiguate-add-year-suffix="true" disambiguate-add-names="true" disambiguate-add-givenname="true" collapse="year-suffix">
    <sort>
      <key macro="author-cite"/>
      <key variable="issued"/>
    </sort>
    <layout prefix="(" suffix=")" delimiter="; ">
      <group delimiter=", ">
        <text macro="author-cite"/>
        <text macro="issued-year"/>
        <group delimiter=" ">
          <label variable="locator" form="short"/>
          <text variable="locator"/>
        </group>
      </group>
    </layout>
  </citation>
  <bibliography et-al-min="100" et-al-use-first="100" hanging-indent="false" entry-spacing="1" line-spacing="1">
    <sort>
      <key macro="author-bib"/>
      <key variable="issued"/>
      <key variable="title"/>
    </sort>
    <layout suffix=".">
      <group delimiter=". ">
        <text macro="author-bib"/>
        <choose>
          <if type="chapter entry-encyclopedia entry-dictionary" match="any">
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="title-bib"/>
              <group delimiter=" ">
                <text term="in"/>
                <names variable="editor" delimiter="; ">
                  <name name-as-sort-order="all" sort-separator=", " initialize-with=". ">
                    <name-part name="family" text-case="uppercase"/>
                  </name>
                  <label form="short" prefix=" (" suffix=")"/>
                </names>
              </group>
              <text variable="container-title" font-weight="bold"/>
              <text macro="edition"/>
              <group delimiter=", ">
                <text macro="publication"/>
                <text macro="issued-year"/>
              </group>
              <group delimiter=" ">
                <label variable="page" form="short"/>
                <text variable="page"/>
              </group>
            </group>
          </if>
          <else-if type="article-journal article-magazine article-newspaper" match="any">
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="title-bib"/>
              <group delimiter=", ">
                <text variable="container-title" font-weight="bold"/>
                <text variable="publisher-place"/>
                <group delimiter=" ">
                  <label variable="volume" form="short"/>
                  <text variable="volume"/>
                </group>
                <group delimiter=" ">
                  <label variable="issue" form="short"/>
                  <text variable="issue"/>
                </group>
                <group delimiter=" ">
                  <label variable="page" form="short"/>
                  <text variable="page"/>
                </group>
                <text macro="issued-full"/>
              </group>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="thesis" match="any">
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="title-bib"/>
              <text macro="issued-year"/>
              <group delimiter=", ">
                <group delimiter=" &#8211; ">
                  <text variable="genre"/>
                  <text variable="publisher"/>
                </group>
                <text variable="publisher-place"/>
                <text macro="issued-year"/>
              </group>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="paper-conference" match="any">
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="title-bib"/>
              <group delimiter=" ">
                <text term="in"/>
                <text variable="event"/>
              </group>
              <text variable="container-title" font-weight="bold"/>
              <group delimiter=", ">
                <text macro="publication"/>
                <text macro="issued-year"/>
              </group>
              <group delimiter=" ">
                <label variable="page" form="short"/>
                <text variable="page"/>
              </group>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="legislation legal_case bill regulation" match="any">
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="title-bib"/>
              <text variable="genre"/>
              <text variable="container-title" font-weight="bold"/>
              <group delimiter=", ">
                <text macro="publication"/>
                <text macro="issued-full"/>
              </group>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else>
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="title-bib"/>
              <text macro="edition"/>
              <group delimiter=", ">
                <text macro="publication"/>
                <text macro="issued-year"/>
              </group>
              <group delimiter=" ">
                <text variable="number-of-pages"/>
                <label variable="number-of-pages" form="short"/>
              </group>
            </group>
          </else>
        </choose>
        <text macro="online"/>
      </group>
    </layout>
  </bibliography>
</style>
